User: In the diagram, two pairs of identical isosceles triangles are cut off of square $ABCD$, leaving rectangle $PQRS$. The total area cut off is $200 \text{ m}^2$. What is the length of $PR$, in meters? [asy]
size(5cm);

pair a = (0, 1); pair b = (1, 1); pair c = (1, 0); pair d = (0, 0);
pair s = (0, 0.333); pair p = (0.667, 1); pair q = (1, 0.667); pair r = (0.333, 0);

// Thicken pen
defaultpen(linewidth(1));

